WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.979 --> 00:00:06.450
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and the other
day I asked everyone to submit all their questions

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:13.450
about the new deathstroke, the flash and all
things arrow season 2, so here’s my first

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.949
of many arrow Q&amp;As this year.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:21.080
Since making longer videos has made harder
to do a greater number of videos each week

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.269
I also comment on community and american horror
story after the q&amp;a part.

00:00:25.269 --> 00:00:30.800
So think of this as also being a super catch
up video.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.480
I’ll be changing my upload schedule soon,
but I’ll post a video explaining.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.400
So be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.450
and follow me on twitter for updates at robot
challenger.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:45.140
Let’s get going, question number 1 - Mikhail
Pace asks Who will be the first Flash Villian?

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.720
In the most current origin story it’s savitar
that killed his mother.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.920
But surprise surprise it turns out professor
zoom is behind it all.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.239
So professor zoom will always be the flash’s
version of the joker.

00:00:55.239 --> 00:00:56.800
The most infamous villain.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.059
But they’ll also have a medium bad, someone
like brother blood.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.370
So we’ll meet that person first.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.420
It will probably be one of the rogues.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:07.680
Question 2 - Jak Gibson (no avatar) asks What
mask do you think is better the one from the

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.140
island or the new one﻿?

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:12.950
I like the new one the best, the old mask
was just a piece of cloth and I hated the

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.430
black and yellow colors together.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.110
I like the new burnt orange steel look better.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.770
I would have been happier if they had stuck
with the yellow and blue color scheme from

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:21.770
the comics.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.750
Question 3 - Ignacio Cotto (no avatar) asks
Could this be Oliver’s father come back

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.610
via the lazarus pit in an episode or are you
fully convinced he died?﻿

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:32.500
I think that Merlin being thea’s father
is the only ‘empire strikes back’ father

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.400
twist we’ll be seeing this season.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:38.280
I always thought of Oliver’s father as a
normal person who became a victim of the shadow

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.280
world.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.500
I don’t think they’ll bend the canon to
make him some supernatural character.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.500
Lazarus pit style.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.590
I think Raysh is the only one the writers
would allow inside the lazarus pit.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:52.780
Question 4 - Jesus Reyes asks Do you think
arrow will talk to deathstroke about the island?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:57.250
Definitely, we haven’t even gotten to the
episode where slade loses his eye and they

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.570
haven’t destroyed the mirakuru yet.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.570
So there’s a big island battle coming still.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:03.260
And he and slade are still friends, so slade
will have to start blaming oliver for shadow’s

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:06.430
death at some point.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:16.400
Queston 5 - delenayel asks When do you expect
Barry to wake up from his coma?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.290
During the pilot episode of the spin off.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:22.299
If they had not decided to just do a full
pilot episode and had used episode 20 as the

00:02:22.299 --> 00:02:33.560
backdoor pilot like they originally planned,
that would have been when he woke up.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:38.040
Question 6 - jack thao (no avatar) asks Do
you think Deathstroke is part of the league

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:42.170
of assassins storyline if so, What if the
show-runners go the grant Morrison path and

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.810
do a son of batman story twist...

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:45.810
But with the Arrow, Where deathstroke tries
to take over the league of assassins by kidnapping

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.739
some sort of love child oliver queen had or
maybe Robert queen had one and it's Oliver's

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:48.739
half Brother...

00:02:48.739 --> 00:02:49.780
(The creators switch the Conor Hawk origins
around he becomes Oliver's half brother...)

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:50.780
do you think it would work?

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:55.200
I don’t think deathstroke is part of the
league, he was special forces, so he was already

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:56.430
a trained assassin.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.420
And with the mirakuru he would have just eventually
learned to control his new abilities.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:03.099
I don’t think that they’ll introduce any
new characters, so Deathstroke will probably

00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:06.900
end up kidnapping Felicity and try to turn
her against Oliver.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:11.769
Remember, he said ‘corrupt those he loves’
and destroy those who work with him.

00:03:11.769 --> 00:03:14.870
So he’ll try to corrupt Felicity and destroy
Roy.

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:19.290
And Barry, if he comes back for the finale
with flash superpowers.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:22.579
Question 7 - Daniel Sezanayev (no avatar)
asks Do you think that Oliver should also

00:03:22.579 --> 00:03:24.700
get injected with the Mirakuru?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.859
In my opinion the villains are just too powerful,
plus now Roy is stronger than him?

00:03:28.859 --> 00:03:33.389
No I don’t think so, one of the big aspects
of green arrow and batman are that they do

00:03:33.389 --> 00:03:34.389
not have superpowers.

00:03:34.389 --> 00:03:39.529
They’re just normal people who are so good
they can be just as effective with superheroes.

00:03:39.529 --> 00:03:43.900
If they gave him super powers it would diminish
his eventual triumph over slade.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:49.969
It’s like saying, real hero’s don’t
need super powers.

00:03:49.969 --> 00:03:53.470
Question 8 - Galaxy Ronin (no avatar) asks
anything you know about the upcoming show

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.470
" Gotham"﻿

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:57.459
Yes, they’ve started casting the non-super
hero roles.

00:03:57.459 --> 00:04:00.200
It’s going to feature Bruce Wayne when he’s
really young.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:04.590
Like before the events of Batman Begins, he’ll
probably be a teenager.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:10.169
Fox paid Warner Brothers a dump truck of money
so that they could use major super heroes

00:04:10.169 --> 00:04:11.311
and characters from the comics.

00:04:11.311 --> 00:04:12.311
So it will be really cool.

00:04:12.311 --> 00:04:16.109
I’ll be doing weekly videos for it, but
it won’t air until the fall.

00:04:16.109 --> 00:04:19.510
So I’ll start doing previews for it around
comic con this summer.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:24.210
Question 9 - Mitch Panthera (no avatar) asks
Do you think Oliver will fully train Roy?

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.600
And what will his name be?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:30.030
This is going to be an empire strikes back
luke skywalker situation, where by Oliver

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.040
Yoda will start Roy’s training.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:36.940
But it took Oliver and even slade years to
become experts, so Roy will complete his training,

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.520
return of the jedi style as the show goes
along in future seasons.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.410
So Roy’s not going to become a jedi level
fighter this season.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:46.160
Oliver is just setting him on the path to
becoming Red Arrow.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.660
He’ll be wearing a red hoodie next week,
so I think they’ll do the same thing they

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.630
did for Oliver, They’ll just call him the
red vigilante or something like that.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.150
It won’t be exactly like the comics.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:58.830
And they’ve already called Thea speedy,
so it definitely won’t be that.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.820
Question 10 and last one: Kyle McKenna asks
Wouldn't Roy be a good match against Slade?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:08.800
I mean they both have the serum and once Oliver
trains him they'll be pretty even.﻿

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:14.880
Roy is untrained and Slade has a lifetime
of experience as an assassin.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:19.740
And he’s had the last 6 years to get used
to the effects of the mirakuru serum.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:23.290
Just because you become super strong and super
fast doesn’t mean you automatically learn

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.780
to be an expert fighter.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.930
So Roy will probably try to take on slade
and get his ass kicked.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.140
The finale will probably be a three on one
fight with slade versus oliver, black canary

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.830
and roy at the same time.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:43.750
