this was a lot of fun.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:50.550
Don’t worry if I didn’t get to your question
I’ll be doing these every week.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.960
I’m changing my upload schedule to make
it a little easier to do bonus videos like

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:54.960
