00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.650
On to American Horror Story - careful for
spoilers, because a lot of really big stuff

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.430
happened.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.500
Number 1 - They implied that fiona is gator
bait.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.510
This is just a way for the writers to say
that misty can’t bring her back.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.430
So I believe that she’s actually dead.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.400
But we might still see her in the afterlife.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.990
We did see Kathy bates and angela bassett
in hell, so I think fiona will appear but

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.270
only as a spirit.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.110
Number 2 - The seven wonders.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:19.360
Everyone will participate.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.860
Remember that black and white film at the
beginning of the episode.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:26.570
It told us that if you attempt the wonders
and you’re not the supreme, you’ll die.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.620
So they want us to think that all of the girls
are going to die except for whoever the new

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:31.620
supreme is.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.970
Number 3 - Supreme predictions.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.090
I actually have three competing theories.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:40.580
My first one is that it really is zoe and
she and franken kyle will live out their days

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.910
in magical bliss.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:45.070
But, that would actually be a bit of a disappointment
from a story standpoint.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:50.030
We’ve spent all season with each of the
girls saying I’m the one, no I’m the one.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.480
Well what if none of them are the one.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.020
And it’s someone we haven’t met.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.300
There’s always a twist.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:57.130
I just seems to convenient for it to be one
of them at this point.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:08:01.790
The third theory is that it really is madison
and she’ll just become the next fiona.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.440
Another terrible supreme that will destroy
the line of salem.

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:06.420
Think of that as like the apocalypse theory.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.360
Like the worst possible outcome.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:09.750
The show says it all in the title.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.580
This is a horror show, so there are no happy
endings.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:15.020
Even for spaulding and his creepy real life
doll baby.

